lines+=['','The fixed parallel .625/60 control isolates iteration from serial scheduling; .8/30 isolates normalization from iteration; .8/60 versus damped .8/60 isolates damping. A lower hard residual or faster convergence is not proof of a better logical class; the paired independent outcomes remain authoritative. The original 504 diagnostic conditioned-system LLR audit matches official LDPC exactly, including signed infinities, with no actual NaN messages; non-finite NumPy interpolation summaries are separately preserved and corrected.']
